{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr. Skritch is one very bad cat - he stole your birds &amp; now he's laughing! Help Sandy explore Komio Island to rescue them before his Cato-Critters turn you into a scratching post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 32 levels across 8 hand-crafted worlds packed full of secrets to find all of your little Bird-Buddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a wide variety of powerups and rides to help along the way - from Bubble-Seeds, Bomb-Boots, Mag-Zaps and Dashing Ponies to the super-rare ScootyCopter there are plenty of skills for Sandy to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat an army of mean (but adorable!) enemies as you climb towards the final showdown on the peak of Mt. Skritch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Super Komio Island</i> is a bright, wholesome and colourful love letter to old-school 2D platformers - filled with vibrant environments, playful action, and cute little ponies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598570?t=1743042077","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/5a97d78860d438159b08ee36be62bdaa18dad8b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743042077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/189c6a5ce87500e0352beaf972777d7db4fa32c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743042077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/189c6a5ce87500e0352beaf972777d7db4fa32c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743042077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr. Skritch is one very bad cat - he stole your birds &amp; now he's laughing! Help Sandy explore Komio Island to rescue them before his Cato-Critters turn you into a scratching post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 32 levels across 8 hand-crafted worlds packed full of secrets to find all of your little Bird-Buddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a wide variety of powerups and rides to help along the way - from Bubble-Seeds, Bomb-Boots, Mag-Zaps and Dashing Ponies to the super-rare ScootyCopter there are plenty of skills for Sandy to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat an army of mean (but adorable!) enemies as you climb towards the final showdown on the peak of Mt. Skritch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Super Komio Island</i> is a bright, wholesome and colourful love letter to old-school 2D platformers - filled with vibrant environments, playful action, and cute little ponies.</p>","developers":["FiveChook"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/5078a81e391ef7e8f881684d283c7cd6cb63661b/header.jpg?t=1743042077","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117849,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117849/movie480.mp4?t=1743042075","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117849/movie_max.mp4?t=1743042075"},"name":"Super Komio Island","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117849/816ef1ac5361da58a5fee64678cd6ac8463fa7c7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743042075","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117849/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743042075","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117849/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743042075"}}],"name":"Super Komio Island","package